  "reference": "Jolevi 27",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "27",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cik ma mako kwoŋ mic m'imiyo Rwoth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth oluwo gi Musa ka waco ama: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luw gi Joisiraili aka iwaci rijo ni: Ka nyatoro otimo cikirok m'oŋeyere ri Rwoth, me rapim m'inyalo kipima gi dhano, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rapim pa ŋat'obedo jacwo labedo; wok i oro piero ario tundo piero aucel labedo siringi piero abic ma feza pesa ma kamaleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ŋato obedo dhako, rapim labedo siringi piero adek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka oro obedo wok abic tundo piero ario, rapim mere labedo siringi ario ri jacwo kodi siringi apar ri dhako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka oro obedo dwe acel tundo oro abic, rapim pa jacwo labedo siringi abic ma feza, aka ri dhako rapim labedo siringi adek ma feza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ka dhano obedo jaoro piero aucel kadho malo, nyaka to rapim pa jacwo labedo siringi apar g'abic, aka apa dhako siringi apar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka nyatoro obedi ma k'onyalo culo rapim, wokel jo ruwaŋ jacway ri Were i wi migam ma lamenyo jo paka gima kisi ŋat'acel acele ma timo cikirok nyalo culo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka mako ogwaŋ m'inyalo kelo paka mic ri Rwoth, nger gino m'inyalo miyo Rwoth bino bedo maleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wongoye man ma wowile gine kosa wolunji waŋe, obedi maber m'iwilo gi marac; kosa marac kodi maber; aka k'ogwaŋ acel owil gi man, ogwaŋ no kodi m'owil gine je labedo maleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'omako ogwaŋ moro je makoc ma kinyal nyewo paka mic ri Rwoth, ogwaŋ no wokel ruwaŋ jacway ri Were i wi migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacway ri were i wi migam lamenyo go; obedi ni ber kosa rac, paka menyo pa jacway ri Were i migam obedi, apaka bey mere labedo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka ŋat'acel no omiti nyewo kendo, go ripo medo acel wiy abic kwoŋ pesa macon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka nyatoro oloko ot maleŋ ri Rwoth, jacway ri Were i wi migam bino menyo bey mere: Obedi maber kosa marac, paka jacway ri Were i wi migam omeny bey, ladoŋ ameno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka ŋata loko ot maleŋ mito nyewo kendo, go lamedo acel wiy abic kwoŋ bey m'oridhi, to gik ri won mere macon kendo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka nyatoro oloko maleŋ lowo moro m'oluwo ri Rwoth, bey mere m'omeny bino bedo marom gi kodhi m'inyalo cwoy'iye: Siringi piero abic ma feza marom kodi kilo miya acel ma bale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka nyatoro oloko maleŋ ndelo paka oro ma piero abic, bey gipi bino cungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka oloki ndelo maleŋ ka oro piero abic orumo, jacway ri Were i wi migam bino timo kwan ma bey mere paka oro m'odoŋ cuka tundo oro piero abic, t'imoja bey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka ŋat'oloko ndelo maleŋ mito nyewo kendo, nyaka lamedo acel wiy abic i wi pesa macon, to gik ri won mere macon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka k'onyew ndelo kendo, kosa k'otana gi ŋatiman, k'onyal nyewirok kendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka ogony ndelo i oro ma piero abic, bino bedo maleŋ ri Rwoth paka ndelo m'omiyere; to lokere gipa jocway ri Were i wi migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka nyatoro oloko maleŋ ri Rwoth ndelo m'otiek nyewo, ma k'obedo lowo alunja, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jacway ri Were i wi migam latimo kwan ka menyo bey ma ripo gine tundo oro piero abic, aka bey m'omeny iripo culo ndelo no won, mic maleŋ ri Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I oro ma piero abic ndelo lagik ri ŋat'oyido onyew gine, m'obedo won ndelo macon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menyo bey je bino bedo paka pesa ma kamaleŋ nitie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nywol marapena p'ogwaŋe, paka obedo makayo, obedo apa Rwoth, ŋatimoro je kiripi loko maleŋ rigo; obedi merikwa kosa rombo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'obedo ogwaŋ makoc, ogwaŋ m'obedo kayo inyalo nyewo t'idwoko kendo i bey m'omeny, gi medo i wiye acel wiy abic; ka k'onyew t'idwoko, inyalo kitana gi ŋatiman i bey ma ripo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
