        },
        {
          "text": "Acel wiy apar ma lowo, obedi kodhi ma lowo kosa olemo ma yath, obedo apa Rwoth; jobedo gimaleŋ ri Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.30",
