          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wongoye ŋata wopenji obedi ni ber kosa rac, kosa wokethi gimoro ma lunjo waŋe; ka dhano okethi gilunjo waŋe, nyaka gigipiny no je kodi gima lunjo waŋe bino bedo maleŋ aka kinyal nyewo t'idwoko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.33",
